    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Numbers",
     "texto": [
      "From 1 to 10 you need to know them by heart. The rest are built by adding and multiplying: **じゅういち** (10 + 1 = 11), **にじゅう** (2 × 10 = 20), **にじゅうご** (25). **ひゃく** is 100.",
      "4, 7 and 9 have two readings. The most common when counting are **よん**, **なな** and **きゅう**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
