    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Age and phone number",
     "texto": [
      "Age is said with the number + **さい**: **25 さい です** (I am 25 years old). There is no «to have» verb here: です is used.",
      "To ask: **なんさい です か** or, more politely, **おいくつ です か**.",
      "The 20 has its own word: **はたち**.",
      "A phone number is asked with **でんわばんごう は なんばん です か**. When saying it, the groups of digits are separated with **の**. Zero is said **ゼロ**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
